This kit adapts ideas from:

- Everything Claude Code (https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code)
  Copyright (c) 2026 Affaan Mustafa — MIT License.
  The council skill and the silent-failure-hunter, test-analyzer and simplifier
  agents are rewritten adaptations of its council, silent-failure-hunter,
  pr-test-analyzer and code-simplifier pieces. The walls follow the idea of its
  gate hooks; the cost meter follows its cost-tracking idea; the context meter
  follows the idea of its strategic-compact hook (reading the context size from
  the transcript); the "checks intact" check follows its config-protection idea.

- Superpowers (https://github.com/obra/superpowers) by Jesse Vincent — MIT License.
  The design and schematic skills hand over to its brainstorming and
  writing-plans skills when it is installed; the status lines, the retry loop and
  the "always pass the model" rule come from its subagent-driven-development, as
  do the ideas of a table of shared files before the first task, of findings the
  reviewer cannot verify from the diff, and of one workspace per plan.

No source files were copied verbatim.
